---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p>
        At LinguaTech, we believe in the power of technology to transform the
        way people learn languages. Our mission is to create innovative tools
        that make language acquisition more natural, engaging, and accessible
        for everyone — from beginners to advanced learners.
      </p>
      <p>
        Founded at the intersection of education, linguistics, and technology,
        LinguaTech is dedicated to building products that prioritize real-world
        comprehension and practical usage. We combine intelligent design, rich
        media, and data-driven insights to deliver learning experiences that go
        beyond textbooks and memorization.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our flagship app, LinguaLoop, reflects our core vision: helping learners
        improve their listening skills through authentic video content and
        interactive practice. And it’s just the beginning.
      </p>
      <p>
        We’re passionate about helping people connect across cultures, one word
        at a time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
  }

  .content {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .content p {
    color: #7a7a7a;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
